      "title": "Lowe's Mylow Assistant Strengthens Its Online Shopping Experience",
      "summary": "Lowe's Companies reported strong Q3 online sales growth of 17.4%, marking its fifth consecutive quarter of double-digit growth. The company's Mylow AI assistant contributed significantly, with users converting at three times the rate of non-users and answering over 1 million questions monthly. Lowe's raised its fiscal 2026 sales outlook to $92.5 billion and expects 0.5% comparable sales growth, with plans to continue focusing on profitable online growth into fiscal 2027.",
